  {
    "type": "item_group",
    "id": "NC_BR1_GATE_GUARD_weapon",
    "subtype": "distribution",
    "//": "A steel spear: it reaches two tiles and stabs through chain-link, so a guard behind the fence can hit a zombie on the other side.",
    "items": [ [ "spear_steel", 100 ] ]
  },
  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_BR1_GATE_GUARD",
    "dynamic_line": [
      "Hands where I can see them till you're through the door.  Nothing personal.  Things out there wear faces.",
      "You're letting the dark in.  In or out, pick one.",
      "Looking for Jonah or Rosa?  Board's by the door.  Dot chalks up who's going out and when.",
      "Quiet shift.  I hate quiet shifts."
    ],
    "responses": [
      { "text": "Seen anything out there?", "topic": "TALK_BR1_GATE_GUARD_NEWS" },
      { "text": "Just passing through.", "topic": "TALK_DONE" }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_BR1_GATE_GUARD_NEWS",
    "dynamic_line": [
      "Something stood at the edge of the light for an hour last night.  Grinning.  Didn't come closer.  The light's the only reason it didn't.",
      "Hounds came sniffing round the sandbags two nights back.  They don't like the light either, but they're braver about it.",
      "Nothing.  Which means it's out there somewhere else, being something to somebody else."
    ],
    "responses": [ { "text": "Thanks.", "topic": "TALK_BR1_GATE_GUARD" } ]
  },
