  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_BR1_ARCHER",
    "dynamic_line": [
      "Keep to the light when you cross the yard.  I can't shoot what I can't see.",
      "Twenty arrows and a good bow.  Guns bring everything in the garage.  This doesn't.",
      "Something stood at the fence last night.  Didn't come in.  I kept an arrow on it till it went.",
      "The runners bring the depot back to life every time they come home.  We'd be eating wallpaper otherwise."
